entries.msgstr:
"...While stands the Coliseum,
Rome shall stand;
When falls the Coliseum, Rome shall fall;
And when Rome falls—the World..."

Light (noun):

1 — Electromagnetic radiation that can be detected by the human eye;

2 — Natural or artificial illumination that enables vision and perception;

3 — An experimental version of the Onslaught game mode in World of Tanks, offering players the chance to enjoy all the 7v7 action of Onslaught in a laid-back atmosphere. Onslaught Light's distinguishing features include a more relaxed pace, the absence of qualification and ranks, and absolutely no arty whatsoever.
